# ===== Config backups =====
# Core backup ở config/backups/; module backup nằm trong folder module (isolation).
# EN: Core backups in config/backups/; module backups live in the module folder.
config/backups/
modules/*/config/backups/

# ===== Secrets (KHÔNG commit token thật / never commit real tokens) =====
# File config thật (chứa token) KHÔNG track — chỉ track config.example.yml.
# EN: The real config file (with token) is untracked — only config.example.yml is tracked.
config/config.yml
config/backups/
# Repo này PUBLIC — nếu lỡ commit token thật, hãy reset token ngay trên Discord Developer Portal.
# EN: This repo is PUBLIC — if a real token is ever committed, revoke it immediately on the
# Discord Developer Portal. Không còn dùng file .env / .env.example.

